embeds.description:
Our Moderator Bears  (ModBears) are here to make sure our cozy little corner of Discord stays a warm and safe Lair for everyone. 🍵 If you ever come across any problems related to our server, don't hesitate to tag them in the channel! ❤️ You can also use the in-server Ticketing System to report any issues at all!

***Our Moderator Bear Team:***
@HamstaXCass (Lead ModBear)
@nonbinarycatdad
@WildWolf944
@jamie_bat
@knifelady01 & @drock052422 (co-mods)
@spazoid420
@Bubbamike77
@Rustynail (and FerociousMango by Proxy - Twitch only)
@Mousey
@demarco9000

Just a quick heads-up, though... The ModBears won't handle issues through DMs between members. If you run into any trouble there, it's best to report it directly to Discord's Trust & Safety Team and block the user.

